; /var/lib/bind/db.hp.teamNN.example on VM 2, the hidden primary (Module 5,
; Lab 5.1). Set the team number (sed 's/NN/01/g' for team 01). Edit the zone
; here, raise the serial, then: sudo rndc reload hp.teamNN.example
; The NS set names only the public server, VM 1 (ns1.teamNN.example).
; VM 2 appears nowhere in the zone, nor in the parent's delegation.
$TTL 60
@       IN SOA  ns1.teamNN.example. hostmaster.teamNN.example. (
                2026102801 ; serial
                3600       ; refresh
                600        ; retry
                1209600    ; expire
                60 )       ; negative caching TTL
        IN NS   ns1.teamNN.example.
www     IN A    192.0.2.120
